  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1405.02 Construction of Accessory Structures. Approval from the department to construct an accessory structure shall not override any applicable more stringent local requirements relating to zoning or building standards.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1400) #12062 eff 12-17-16; ss by #12810, eff 12-15-19; ss by #13425, eff 8-2-22",
